                                "sense_id": "50445a30-b1e7-3de6-baed-999fa1ec0ec3",
                                "text": "1996, Tim “Salvage”, quoted in Ian Fisher, “Erin’s looking for Leg-Rub Steve. Fly’s looking for CD’s to steal. Star’s looking for Jaya. And it’s starting to get cold.”\nI don’t spange much because I really don’t like doing it. I eat out of trash cans a lot."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "43d71f29-710c-4dfd-807b-1ff5c687a738",
                                "sense_id": "50445a30-b1e7-3de6-baed-999fa1ec0ec3",
                                "text": "2009, Kelly Myers, 33, quoted in Joe Deegan, “Nowhere To Go”, San Diego Reader\nThen my father would send all us kids out to ‘spange’ [beg for spare change]. You could sometimes make $50 a day by spanging. Other days you might make a dollar."
